&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-redactor-tag=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;The venue…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SOHO HOUSE BERLIN ist ein privater Mitgliederclub und ein Hotel in einem denkmalgeschützten Gebäude im Herzen der Hauptstadt. Neben Restaurants, einem Fitnessstudio, einem Pool auf dem Dach, einem hauseigenen Kino und einem großzügigen Spa-Bereich bietet das Hotel 65 Zimmer in verschiedenen Größen, 20 Apartments und vier Lofts. Neben Berlin und Großbritannien gibt es weitere Häuser in den USA, Toronto, Barcelona, Amsterdam, Istanbul und Mumbai. Zum SOHO HOUSE gehört auch der Concept Store THE STORE X. THE STORE X ist eine Plattform für Ideen und Kultur. Das Sortiment umfasst Mode, Kunst und Design und zieht außerdem eine globale Gemeinschaft kreativer Menschen in die 180 The Strand in London, ins Soho House Berlin und zur Soho Farmhouse in Oxfordshire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-redactor-tag=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Ziel der Position...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Der Senior Accountant ist verantwortlich für die ordnungsgemaesse Durchfuehrung der Finanzbuchhaltung sowie die Erstellung von Monats-, Quartals- und Jahresabschluessen. Er stellt die Einhaltung gesetzlicher, steuerlicher sowie konzerninterner Vorgaben (UK GAAP) sicher und fungiert als kompetenter Ansprechpartner fuer Wirtschaftspruefer, Steuerberater und interne Stakeholder.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Anforderungen...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Finanzbuchhaltung:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eigenverantwortliche Durchfuehrung der Hauptbuch-, Debitoren-, Kreditoren- und Anlagenbuchhaltung -&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sicherstellung der korrekten Verbuchung saemtlicher Geschaeftsvorfaelle nach HGB sowie den Reporting-Anforderungen des Konzerns (UK GAAP) -&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Durchfuehrung von Kontenabstimmungen und Analyse von Bilanz- und GuV-Konten -&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ueberwachung und Abstimmung von Intercompany-Sachverhalten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sicherstellung einer ordnungsgemaessen Dokumentation und Archivierung von Buchhaltungsunterlagen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstuetzung bei der Optimierung und Standardisierung von Buchhaltungsprozessen Monats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monats-, Quartals- und Jahresabschluesse:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quartals- und Jahresabschluessen nach HGB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erstellung von Reporting-Packages gemaess Konzernvorgaben (UK GAAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Durchfuehrung von Abschlussbuchungen sowie Rueckstellungs- und Abgrenzungsberechnungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse und Kommentierung wesentlicher Bilanz- und GuV-Positionen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mitwirkung bei externen Jahresabschlusspruefungen&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Steuern und Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstuetzung bei der Erstellung von Steuererklaerungen und steuerlichen Auswertungen&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sicherstellung der Einhaltung steuerlicher und handelsrechtlicher Vorschriften&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ansprechpartner fuer Steuerberater, Wirtschaftspruefer sowie Behoerden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mitwirkung bei Betriebs-, Umsatzsteuer- und Steuerpruefungen&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vorbereitung und Erstellung der Umsatzsteuervoranmeldungen sowie weiterer steuerlicher Meldungen in Zusammenarbeit mit dem externen Steuerberater&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Reporting und Finance Support:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse von Finanzkennzahlen und Bilanzpositionen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstuetzung bei Budget-, Forecast- und Planungsprozessen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifikation von Abweichungen und Erarbeitung entsprechender Handlungsempfehlungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erstellung regelmaessiger Finanzberichte sowie Ad-hoc-Auswertungen fuer Management und Konzern&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Prozess- und Systemoptimierung:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weiterentwicklung und Digitalisierung von Finanz- und Accounting-Prozessen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mitarbeit bei Finance- und ERP-Projekten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aktive Unterstuetzung beim geplanten Wechsel von Sage 200 auf Oracle Fusion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimierung interner Kontrollen sowie Sicherstellung der Einhaltung von Konzernstandards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Anforderungen:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfolgreich abgeschlossene kaufmaennische Ausbildung, idealerweise als Steuerfachangestellter (m/w/d), ergaenzt durch eine Weiterbildung zum Bilanzbuchhalter (IHK) oder eine vergleichbare Qualifikation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mehrjaehrige Berufserfahrung (mindestens 5 Jahre) im Rechnungswesen, in der Finanzbuchhaltung oder Steuerberatung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fundierte Kenntnisse im Handels- und Steuerrecht (insbesondere HGB)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Praxiserfahrung in der Erstellung von Monats-, Quartals- und Jahresabschluessen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit ERP-Systemen, idealerweise Sage 200; Erfahrung mit Oracle Fusion ist von Vorteil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Kenntnisse in MS Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strukturierte, selbststaendige und loesungsorientierte Arbeitsweise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgepraegte Zahlenaffinitaet und analytisches Denkvermoegen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hohe Verantwortungsbereitschaft und Qualitaetsorientierung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gute Kommunikations- und Teamfaehigkeit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hohe Integritaet sowie ein sorgfaeltiger Umgang mit vertraulichen Informationen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gute bis sehr gute Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift, insbesondere fuer die Kommunikation mit internationalen Konzernfunktionen und die Bearbeitung von Reporting-Anforderungen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 bezahlte „Volunteer Days“ pro Kalenderjahr (zur Unterstützung wohltätiger Zwecke).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monatliche Filmvorführungen im hauseigenen Kino mit aktuellen Filmen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monatliche Trainingsmöglichkeiten (einschließlich abteilungsübergreifender Angebote).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wöchentliche Yoga-/Pilates-Kurse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50 % Rabatt auf unsere Cowshed-Produkte.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rabatte bei externen Anbietern (Corporate Benefits).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir möchten darauf hinweisen, dass wir Ihre Daten im Rahmen des Bewerbungsverfahrens gemäß den Bestimmungen des Bundesdatenschutzgesetzes speichern und verarbeiten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;At Qualtrics, we create software that the world’s best brands use to deliver exceptional frontline experiences, build high-performing teams, and design products people love. But we are more than a platform. We are the creators and stewards of the Experience Management category serving over 18,000 clients globally. Building a category takes grit, determination, and an appreciation for the unconventional—but most of all it requires close-knit, high-functioning teams with an unwavering dedication to serving our customers. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When you join one of our teams, you’ll be part of a nimble group that’s empowered to set ambitious goals and move fast to achieve them. Strategic risks are encouraged, and complex problems are solved by collaborating and iterating until the best solution comes to light. You won’t have to look to find growth opportunities— they’ll find you. From retail to government to healthcare, we’re on a mission to bring humanity, connection, and empathy back to business. Join over 5,000 people across the globe who think that’s work worth doing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Payroll Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why We Have This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As Qualtrics continues to scale globally, our payroll operations must be as innovative and reliable as our software. We are looking for a Payroll Specialist to ensure our 5,000+ employees across 25 countries are supported with precision. You will sit at the intersection of people and numbers, playing a critical role in major corporate milestones like M&amp;amp;A integrations and the launch of our new global payroll vendor. Working closely with Finance and HR leadership, you’ll help us build a world-class payroll function that thrives on accuracy and empathy.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Find Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meticulous Accuracy: You have a &quot;measure twice, cut once&quot; mentality, ensuring complex data across multiple currencies and tax laws is flawless.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical Curiosity: You don’t just move data; you enjoy using Excel (vlookups, pivot tables) to find patterns, conduct audits, and identify efficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative Communication: You bridge the gap between different time zones and departments, creating trust through clear and proactive updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial Initiative: You understand the desired outcome and work independently to research evolving tax regulations or solve problems before they escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability: You thrive in a transformational environment, remaining calm and confidential while navigating the &quot;scrappy&quot; nature of a high-growth company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Grow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Jurisdiction Expertise: Gain deep knowledge of payroll, tax, and labor laws across key APJ markets including Australia, South Korea, Hong Kong, Japan, India, and Singapore.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems Implementation: Participate in a major global payroll software rollout, giving you highly marketable technical implementation experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;M&amp;amp;A Exposure: Learn the complexities of corporate growth by assisting in the payroll and data integration of newly acquired companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Regional Operational Excellence: Support payroll operations for the APJ region to ensure 100% timely and accurate pay cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Data Integrity: Maintain the &quot;source of truth&quot; for all employment records and verifications to ensure seamless internal reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize Compliance: Conduct detailed audits of payroll, benefits, and long-term incentives to identify and implement corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Global Transformation: Actively contribute to the implementation of our new global payroll system and M&amp;amp;A integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain Audit Readiness: Facilitate annual internal and external audits to ensure global compliance and risk mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For On Your Resume&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educational Foundation: Bachelor’s degree in Business, Human Resources, Finance, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capability over Tenure: No prior experience required. 2+ years of experience; we highly value ambitious recent graduates with strong internship experience in HR or Finance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Proficiency: Demonstrated experience with Microsoft Excel (specifically vlookups and pivot tables).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Mindset: Experience or a strong interest in working with international teams and navigating diverse regulatory environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Should Know About This Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative Global Reach: You aren&#39;t just working in a silo; you are part of a tight-knit global team that supports every Qualtrics employee worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-Impact Milestones: This team is at the center of the company’s biggest moves, from acquisitions to system overhauls—your work will be visible to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth-Obsessed: We believe in &quot;passing the mic&quot; and iterating. On this team, if you are ready for a new challenge, it will find you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team’s Favorite Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualtrics Experience Program: $1,800 annual stipend for an experience of your choosing (eligible after one year).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holistic Time Off: 30 paid days off (15 PTO, 5 Personal Days, and 10 Holiday Closures).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-Life Integration: Frequent office events, team outings, and rooftop views designed to foster creativity and connection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Office Culture: We provide snacks, drinks, and free lunches in our collaborative, open-concept workspaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Care: Full medical, dental, and vision coverage for employees and their families.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Qualtrics Hybrid Work Model&lt;/strong&gt;: Our hybrid work model is elegantly simple: we all gather in the office three days a week; Mondays and Thursdays, plus one day selected by your organizational leader. These purposeful in-person days in thoughtfully designed offices help us do our best work and harness the power of collaboration and innovation. For the rest of the week, work where you want, owning the integration of work and life. #hybrid&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Qualtrics is an equal opportunity employer meaning that all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, status as a protected veteran, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;​​​​​​​Applicants in the United States of America have rights under Federal Employment Laws:&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd/posters/fmla&quot;&gt;Family &amp;amp; Medical Leave Act&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/poster&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity Employment&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd/posters/employee-polygraph-protection-act&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Qualtrics is committed to the inclusion of all qualified individuals. As part of this commitment, Qualtrics will ensure that persons with disabilities are provided with reasonable accommodations. If reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and/or to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, please let your Qualtrics contact/recruiter know.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Not finding a role that’s the right fit for now? Qualtrics Insiders is the one-stop shop for all things Qualtrics Life. Sign up for exclusive access to content created with you in mind and get the scoop on what we have going on at Qualtrics - upcoming events, behind the scenes stories from the team, interview tips, hot jobs, and more. No spam - we promise! You&#39;ll hear from us two times a month max with fresh, totally tailored info - so be sure to stay connected as you explore your best role and company fit.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Scale AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scale AI accelerates the development and deployment of AI, from the high-quality training data and evaluation services that power the world&#39;s leading AI labs, to full-stack AI applications built for Enterprise, U.S. Public Sector, and Global Public Sector customers. We don&#39;t just hand over a model; we find the highest-value use case, build the system around it, and own the outcome, whether that&#39;s an agent supporting mission planning for the Department of Defense, a sovereign AI platform for a government ministry, or an agentic workflow inside a Fortune 500 enterprise. Our platform powers breakthroughs at the frontier of AI, and great design is how we make that power accessible, intuitive, and trusted by the teams who rely on it every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a product design leader to lead and grow our enterprise team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the direction for Enterprise design.&lt;/strong&gt; Define what exceptional design looks like for Scale&#39;s Applications customers making high-stakes decisions and for the expert contributors powering the platform. Translate the broader design vision into a clear, motivating direction for your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and lead the team.&lt;/strong&gt; Own hiring, development, and day-to-day leadership for a growing team of designers. Create the culture and operating rhythms that let them do their best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive design execution across the Enterprise product.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with your Product and Engineering counterparts to set priorities and ensure design is involved from problem scoping through delivery, not brought in at the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the craft bar.&lt;/strong&gt; Uphold design principles and quality standards on your team. Push designers beyond digitizing workflows toward genuinely rethinking how people work with AI. Hold the line on quality without slowing delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to the design system.&lt;/strong&gt; Help shape and adopt Scale&#39;s shared design system, championing consistent component use and contributing patterns back so a distributed team can build coherently at speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ground the team in user needs.&lt;/strong&gt; Build the research habits and cadences that keep your team&#39;s decisions rooted in what enterprise customers and users actually need, and advocate for that discipline with your Product and Engineering partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape Scale&#39;s approach to human-agent interaction.&lt;/strong&gt; Scale&#39;s core value is human-in-the-loop AI, and the interface is where trust is built or lost. Help define the interaction patterns for how enterprise users work alongside AI agents, and contribute to Scale&#39;s growing point of view on this emerging space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years managing product design teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of simplifying data-dense, power-user workflows into elegant solutions for B2B and beyond&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply customer-centric, with a track record of grounding design decisions in real user needs and business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in how AI is changing design practice and tooling; building AI-native workflows for your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing for agentic platforms, and excited to shape the future of interaction patterns for AI and human-in-the-loop systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance speed and quality; you know how to prioritize ruthlessly and get the team shipping without dropping the craft bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator. You can present to a leaders and a front-line PM and make both feel heard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1,0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;PLEASE NOTE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our policy requires a 90-day waiting period before reconsidering candidates for the same role. This allows us to ensure a fair and thorough evaluation of all applicants.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Scale, our mission is to develop reliable AI systems for the world&#39;s most important decisions. Our products provide the high-quality data and full-stack technologies that power the world&#39;s leading models, and help enterprises and governments build, deploy, and oversee AI applications that deliver real impact. We work closely with industry leaders like Meta, &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ernst&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; Young, Mayo Clinic, Time Inc., the Government of Qatar, and U.S. government agencies including the Army and Air Force. We are expanding our team to accelerate the development of AI applications.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe that everyone should be able to bring their whole selves to work, which is why we are proud to be an inclusive and equal opportunity workplace. We are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability status, gender identity or Veteran status.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with physical and mental disabilities. If you need assistance and/or a reasonable accommodation in the application or recruiting process due to a disability, please contact us at ----- Please see the United States Department of Labor&#39;s &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights poster&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; for additional information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We comply with the United States Department of Labor&#39;s &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pay Transparency provision&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PLEASE NOTE: &lt;/strong&gt;We collect, retain and use personal data for our professional business purposes, including notifying you of job opportunities that may be of interest and sharing with our affiliates. We limit the personal data we collect to that which we believe is appropriate and necessary to manage applicants’ needs, provide our services, and comply with applicable laws. Any information we collect in connection with your application will be treated in accordance with our internal policies and programs designed to protect personal data. Please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://scale.com/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt; for additional information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nebius Managed Kubernetes (mk8s) mission is to grow the Nebius cloud platform by providing a Kubernetes-native way to run AI systems with high efficiency and low operational overhead.&amp;nbsp;With a single click, it provides a Kubernetes cluster on top of Nebius services for compute (VMs) and networking.&amp;nbsp;In 2026, the service is scaling 10× and is expected to manage customer workloads across tens of thousands of GPU servers in more than 10 data centers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the mk8s Core team, one of three mk8s teams. The Core team owns the API, the core of the service control plane, cluster autoscaling, platform integrations, and running k8s add-ons.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Nebius, team leads are hands-on. We expect you to be a senior or staff engineer now (or earlier in your career). You will start as an individual contributor to gain context, then take on managerial responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you will be responsible to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead by example.&lt;/strong&gt; Set the quality bar by spending a significant portion of your time on IC work: writing and reviewing code, leading projects, and participating in on-call rotation, incident mitigation, and post-incident analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage 4–8 mid-to-senior engineers.&lt;/strong&gt; Provide context, coach, and give regular feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain the technical vision&lt;/strong&gt; for your area of responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with the Product Manager and Service Owner&lt;/strong&gt; to shape product vision and plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Examples of outcomes you could drive as a Team Lead&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize the service control plane to create and manage 20K GPU nodes in a single Kubernetes cluster, enabling a major contract for the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate cluster autoscaling approaches (e.g., Karpenter) to improve resource utilization and support seamless auto-upgrades.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide a Kubernetes-native way to use local disks to reduce disk I/O bottlenecks for AI training and inference, improving efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver managed Layer 7 load balancers to reduce operational overhead for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring to the table:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional software engineering or management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of Golang, or you are ready to quickly switch to this programming language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-month technical projects&lt;/li&gt;
